{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/053fea8e7ea2d3311cd62e435f27afdc.poster.avif?t=1758217806\" aria-label=\"Animation showing how your special cards will trigger depending on the cards you play\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/053fea8e7ea2d3311cd62e435f27afdc.webm?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/053fea8e7ea2d3311cd62e435f27afdc.mp4?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LingoRogue is a rouge like deck builder where your deck is made up of language flash-cards. Build a strong deck with crazy combos and utilize the foreign and native words in your deck. Wisely choose your opponents based on your current deck and score as high as you can. Every game will be different. Learn new words effortlessly as you have fun for hours on end.<br><br>Core mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juicy satisfying animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly endless possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actually fun</strong> to play <strong>Language learner</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it plays</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In LingoRogue your goal is to build a deck of language flashcards, which when played in combinations grants your points. Every round you invite an opponent in the tavern to play against, with increasing difficulty. Visit the shop to upgrade your deck, and seek cards that will go well with the words in your current deck of flash cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the best hand to play every turn</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Hands will yield different points. Your special cards will also trigger on specific hands or words / colors / letters. Maximize your potential score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/84f7a3d0890fdad610874e0456a1d78a.poster.avif?t=1758217806\" aria-label=\"Animation showing how you select and play cards.\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/84f7a3d0890fdad610874e0456a1d78a.webm?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/84f7a3d0890fdad610874e0456a1d78a.mp4?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get the points from your hand you must select the correct translation for all scoring cards. Don't know the right answer? Just flip the card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/4b2e6e1fb647cf1861d23f2af28b6241.poster.avif?t=1758217806\" aria-label=\"Animation shows selecting the right answer gives addicting animations\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/4b2e6e1fb647cf1861d23f2af28b6241.webm?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/4b2e6e1fb647cf1861d23f2af28b6241.mp4?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Flipping</i></strong> the card reveals the correct answer and lets you proceed with the hand. But flipped cards will score lower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/6a943761447be9821b1a79496e104a36.poster.avif?t=1758217806\" aria-label=\"Animation shows how if you don&#039;t know the word, flip the flash card to reveal the answer!\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/6a943761447be9821b1a79496e104a36.webm?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/6a943761447be9821b1a79496e104a36.mp4?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activating your special cards starts satisfying  animations! Some cards score based on letters in your word-cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/053fea8e7ea2d3311cd62e435f27afdc.poster.avif?t=1758217806\" aria-label=\"Animation showing how your special cards will trigger depending on the cards you play\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/053fea8e7ea2d3311cd62e435f27afdc.webm?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/053fea8e7ea2d3311cd62e435f27afdc.mp4?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round you select a traveller to play against. They offer unique rewards or challenges for every round. Find one that suits your current strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/c914bab76150e0407ccfa56b491138d5.poster.avif?t=1758217806\" aria-label=\"Animation shows how travelers offer unique rewards or challenges\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/c914bab76150e0407ccfa56b491138d5.webm?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/c914bab76150e0407ccfa56b491138d5.mp4?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Purchase upgrades</i></strong>\u00a0after every completed run. Build a deck that suits your current words and other upgrades.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/7c344ffe45c23390af6e2f4fffa0630b.poster.avif?t=1758217806\" aria-label=\"Animation shows purchase of upgrades for your deck\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/7c344ffe45c23390af6e2f4fffa0630b.webm?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/7c344ffe45c23390af6e2f4fffa0630b.mp4?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game is unique with different words in your deck. Increase your vocabulary or replay the same words if you like! Track which words you've mastered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/41fa9ecfb7f182abf6718afde5adc615.poster.avif?t=1758217806\" aria-label=\"Animation shows how every game will have a new set of words or you can replay the same words if desired!\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/41fa9ecfb7f182abf6718afde5adc615.webm?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/41fa9ecfb7f182abf6718afde5adc615.mp4?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported Languages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So far you can choose to learn any of the following languages: Norwegian, English, Japanese, Chinese, Italian, Brazilian Portuguese, Spanish, French and German. More languages will be added by popular demand.<br><br><br>Extended mechanics and strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round your dominant card color will be turned into a knowledge point. Exchange these for upgrades beyond the store. Got a combination of cards you like? Try to get the color-upgrade that best suits your deck! <br> <br>Different languages have a different frequency of words and letters. This means LingoRogue will have different best strategies depending on the language you choose! Which language will you master?\u00a0 <br> <br>In LingoRogue hard mode you must be able to translate your flashcards if you want them to score.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565340?t=1758217806","backgrou