lass=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/7c344ffe45c23390af6e2f4fffa0630b.poster.avif?t=1758217806\" aria-label=\"Animation shows purchase of upgrades for your deck\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/7c344ffe45c23390af6e2f4fffa0630b.webm?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/7c344ffe45c23390af6e2f4fffa0630b.mp4?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game is unique with different words in your deck. Increase your vocabulary or replay the same words if you like! Track which words you've mastered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/41fa9ecfb7f182abf6718afde5adc615.poster.avif?t=1758217806\" aria-label=\"Animation shows how every game will have a new set of words or you can replay the same words if desired!\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/41fa9ecfb7f182abf6718afde5adc615.webm?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/extras/41fa9ecfb7f182abf6718afde5adc615.mp4?t=1758217806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported Languages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So far you can choose to learn any of the following languages: Norwegian, English, Japanese, Chinese, Italian, Brazilian Portuguese, Spanish, French and German. More languages will be added by popular demand.<br><br><br>Extended mechanics and strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round your dominant card color will be turned into a knowledge point. Exchange these for upgrades beyond the store. Got a combination of cards you like? Try to get the color-upgrade that best suits your deck! <br> <br>Different languages have a different frequency of words and letters. This means LingoRogue will have different best strategies depending on the language you choose! Which language will you master?\u00a0 <br> <br>In LingoRogue hard mode you must be able to translate your flashcards if you want them to score.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Tobias Software AS"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565340/6066e48f8c4d3efde9e8a6e90492a3e509ccb00e/header.jpg?t=1758217806","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any version newer than 2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux version newer than 2020<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics with full Vulkan 1.2 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sequoia 15.4<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://v